    written_any_signature_diagnostic_reported_twice_2026-11-14, 0, "Filed 2026-11-14 lane p3-batch-c. Signature types are lowered twice (callable-type registration + declaration lowering) so each written Any in a param/return type yields two W/E-ANY-COMPILE-001 diagnostics; locals yield one. Red: test/01_unit/compiler/30.types/written_any_compile_mode_spec.spl (expected 2, got 4). Type spans are all zero, so span de-dup is impossible; do not silence the registration pass without proving full coverage (would widen Any)."

